 liquidity dynamic really  starts to inflect or at least afford  outlook for it to start to reflect lower  because what we've seen historically  going back to 2017 heading into 2018 was  that bitcoin you know ahead of these big  market moves tends to be a leading  indicator um obviously bitcoin peaked um  you know in in q1 of last year prior to  the stock market you know so there there  is some leading characteristics with  respect to bitcoin and partially because  it's more of a pure market right again  i'm not i'm you know it's certainly not  a bitcoin cheerleader i think it's just  i think of bitcoin the same way i think  of all the other uh they're like kids in  the portfolio construction you know one  kid sometimes or is acting up someone  said one kid's out there winning awards  sometimes and it's witches reality is is  understanding portfolio construction and  where each of these these children fit  in that context is really the name of  the game  in my opinion

